/Title (Business Context: ITB, a Vietnamese consumer-finance company, sought to move from a reactive, collections-oriented view of customers toward a proactive financial-wellbeing view - understanding how customers spend, how healthy their finances look month to month, and how engaged they are with digital channels. This analysis uses a synthetic 2025 dataset \(1,852,394 transactions; 999 customers; 34 provinces\) to build customer segments and design non-punitive support actions. This is not a credit-risk scoring exercise.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1521 0 R
/Next 1717 0 R
>>
